Material Symbols icons
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Material Symbols (https://github.com/google/material-design-icons), Copyright Google LLC,
Apache License 2.0, at commit 10ecc14790612ca8fd164e3f4ffe9c16fc50d5b7.
- plugin/skills/material3/scripts/verify/symbols-paths.json holds hashes of the official path data
  (Outlined, Rounded and Sharp; weight 400, grade 0, 24 px; unfilled and filled).
- plugin/skills/material3/assets/icons/symbols-outlined-24.tsv holds the official Android vector
  path data of the Outlined style at the same instance, copied unchanged and repacked one icon per
  line. The skill writes it back into the official vector drawable form for the icons a project uses.
- The Material Symbols variable font and its codepoints file are listed under Fonts.

